  "sourceText": "Peanut Garlic Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 2, 2009 - 11:25pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 teaspoons Creamy peanut butter\n2 tablespoons Fish sauce\n2 tablespoons Chicken stock\n1 teaspoon Minced garlic\n1 teaspoon Red curry paste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Put the peanut butter into a blender,and add the fish sauce and stock.Blend well.Add the garlic and curry paste,and blend until smooth.",
